OL,3,GNEWSAHenry Nowak's family criticise
OL,4,Akiller's appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FHenry Nowak's family say it is "not
OL,7,Fright" his killer is trying to appeal
OL,8,Fagainst his sentence, as the Court of
OL,9,FAppeal hears bids to have it cut or
OL,10,Fincreased.
OL,12,FVickrum Digwa, 23, was jailed for life
OL,13,Fwith a minimum term of 21 years for
OL,14,Fmurdering the 18-year-old student. He
OL,15,Fargues it is too severe, while the
OL,16,Fgovernment has asked for it to be
OL,17,Freviewed as unduly lenient. Both will
OL,18,Fbe heard on Thursday.
OL,20,FJudges will decide whether to allow
OL,21,Feither challenge to proceed and, if so,
OL,22,Fconsider the arguments.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
